  "content": "\n\nPlease provide the text you would like me to translate into zh-CN.\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">通用附魔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 扩展了 Minecraft 的附魔系统，允许附魔应用于更多物品，移除了不必要的兼容性限制，并在此过程中优化了若干原版附魔。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">难道只有剑才能独占乐趣吗？将 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 附魔在三叉戟 🔱 上，将 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 附魔在弩 🏹 上，将 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 附魔在斧头 🪓 上，或将护甲类附魔用于动物护甲 🛡️。本模组合乎原版玩法基调的同时，解锁了无数全新的搭配组合。⚔️</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">除了扩展兼容性外，若干附魔还获得了实用的体验优化。 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 真正实现了“无限”使用 ♾️，</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 与 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">效率</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 能额外掉落经验 💎，</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 变得更加高效 🎯，等等。每项改动均可单独配置 ⚙️，让你打造出最契合你世界的附魔体系。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更多武器可附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 斧头、三叉戟、战锤、弓、弩、盾牌及其他装备现在可以应用许多原本无法使用的现有附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">拓展远程战斗：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 弓可以附魔 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速装填</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 和 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">；弩则可以附魔 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">力量</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">击退</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">火焰</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 和 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">强化三叉戟与战锤：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可为其附魔 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">击退</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">亡灵杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">节肢杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿刺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">破甲</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 等附魔，打造威力强大的全新武器组合。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">动物护甲可附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 马铠、狼铠与鹦鹉螺壳盔现在可以享受多种护甲附魔的加成，包括 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">摔落保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">冰霜行者</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灵魂疾行</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">荆棘</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">减少附魔冲突限制：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> + </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">经验修补</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以及 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> + </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 等热门组合现默认兼容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可选伤害附魔叠加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可配置使 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 与 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">亡灵杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">节肢杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿刺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">破甲</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 同时生效，而非互斥。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可选护甲附魔叠加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 允许在同一件装备上将 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 与 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">火焰保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">爆炸保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">弹射物保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 叠加使用。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">优化原版附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 附魔不再需要预留箭矢；</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 和 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">效率</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 附魔可增加经验掉落；</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">摔落保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 附魔可防止踩踏农田；</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 则受益于弹射物免疫机制的移除。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">完全可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 所有兼容性更改与附魔调整均可通过数据包进行独立开启、关闭或完全自定义。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric 与 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可通过游戏内模组菜单直接进行配置（Fabric 端需安装由 Prospector 开发的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目录下，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具体取决于配置类型。模组可能并不包含所有类型的配置文件。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">本模组自带数个可选数据包，用于扩展现有附魔可应用的物品范围并启用新的附魔组合。每个数据包专注于特定的物品组或附魔组，且可独立控制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">创建世界时可在 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">数据包</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 界面中启用或禁用这些数据包，或在已有世界及多人服务器中通过 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">/datapack</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 命令进行管理。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">详细的文档说明、所有内置数据包的完整参考指南，以及本模组提供的额外数据包功能介绍，均可在 GitHub 上的 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 文件中查阅。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-walls\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
